        "original_id": "6e6ee790-1b2d-56f0-bf02-e72c0b737dff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film), Jesus (1999 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Jeremy Sisto, Jacqueline Bisset, Debra Messing\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures\n- Roles: Pontius Pilate, Mary of Nazareth, Mary Magdalene\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Oldman was born on 21 March 1958 and is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Jesus is a 1999 film that stars Jeremy Sisto as Jesus, Jacqueline Bisset as Mary of Nazareth, Debra Messing as Mary Magdalene, and Gary Oldman as Pontius Pilate.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a string of box office bombs, including The Scarlet Letter, and the company closed in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
